<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco Systems.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco Systems.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it reiterated a strong buy rating on Cisco Systems Inc.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Cisco gained 2-7/8 to 53-3/4.</p>
